# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine. Seeded by Claude 2026-10-27, OWNED BY CODEX from here
# (docs/LANES.md, roadmap task M0.3).
#
# Everything below is generated. Committing any of it is how a 200MB repo
# becomes a 40GB one, and DerivedDataCache alone can outgrow the whole project.
# Exit criterion for M0.3: a full build leaves `git status` clean.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Build output and intermediates
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Build/
.vs/
.idea/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# Generated project files
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user

# Packaged builds - these go to Steam, never to git
Packaged/
Dist/

# Crash and log output
Saved/Crashes/
Saved/Logs/

# NOTE: Content/ is NOT ignored. It is versioned in Git LFS - see
# .gitattributes. The one part of it that is generated is Content/Data/,
# rebuilt on demand from data/*.json by Tools/import_data.py and the Unreal
# editor writer. Generated assets are never hand-edited or committed: keeping
# them out of LFS avoids binary churn when balance values change.
/Content/Data/

# Local Codex attachment cache. It is tooling scratch, never project source.
/.codex-remote-attachments/
